@goodjin2/dsh-superpowers README · dsh-superpowers：Run [Superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) — spec-driven development — as a
DeepSeek Harness agent preset, with **a different subagent model for every skill**,
chosen from a Settings page.

@goodjin2/dsh-superpowers README · Upgrading：Re-running the install command updates everything — the plugin half and the
preset, which travels with the package. There is no copied directory to keep
in sync.

@goodjin2/dsh-superpowers README · License：MIT — see [LICENSE](LICENSE). The bundled skills are from
[obra/superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers), also MIT; see
[THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
